          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Maintenance, not just incidents"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Per-vehicle damage tracked by component and severity — cosmetic, minor, moderate — with an open/resolved status, so maintenance planning doesn’t require cross-referencing a spreadsheet against the incident log.\nFour vehicles, four fixture entries — the same typed shape a real maintenance feed would use."
        }
